WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.085
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama is sharing an idea in a group. When should you speak?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.755
The answer is: When your partner has finished. Conversation needs listening and

00:00:10.755 --> 00:00:11.155
turn-taking.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:16.727
Watch and read: Ama asks: You ask about a book. What makes a good conversation?

00:00:17.533 --> 00:00:21.992
The answer is: Listen and answer in turn. Take turns and pay attention.
